{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303195","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303195","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430319501:1":{"text":"그런가...인듀어 님이 여왕을 죽였으니 이제 셀로클랜드는 어떻게 될까?","source_cn":"这样啊……你说因度厄杀死女王之后，萨洛克兰会变成什么样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE64A50FE39F1FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430319502:1":{"text":"솔직히 말해서 귀족 나으리들과 대등하게 될 줄은 몰랐어.","source_cn":"说实话，我从没敢想过和贵族老爷们平起平坐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8156A4944B44B6DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430319503:1":{"text":"웃지 마... 사실 난 귀족 나으리들의 애완동물처럼 은혜의 이슬을 넉넉하게 받는 것만으로도 만족하거든...","source_cn":"不怕你笑话，只要让我和贵族老爷的宠物一样灵露管够，我就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D911478D7A93EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民维瑟尔":{"text":"평민 비세르","source":"平民维瑟尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:平民艾德":{"text":"평민 에이드","source":"平民艾德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}